  // replacer below can chip each one. The AI groups multiple cites in a single
  // bracket and uses ranges — e.g. "[25, 36-47, 552]" — none of which the
  // single-token regex can match (commas, spaces, hyphens aren't in the token
  // charset), so the whole bracket lands on screen as raw text. Expand
