// ─── [IDX-REDLINE-ALIGN] each paragraph's own OOXML, for its redline markers ─
// getOoxml's package also carries the headers, footers and the footnote and endnote separators (12 more <w:p> on a
// plain two-party MTA), so counting <w:p> over all of it never matched the paragraph count and every paragraph lost
// its [INSERTED/DELETED by] markers. The main document's <w:body> only, text boxes out (body.paragraphs skips them).

